{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p>Which expression is equivalent to <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 9 x squared plus 6 right parenthesis minus left parenthesis 8 x squared right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>?</p>", "keys": ["61b44804-0b3f-40d8-aa6d-9ccc5a990833"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "7c4d5384-c7ba-44e0-b7f5-187f6141966e", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "014fa24f-a953-4747-be86-7e130552a415", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"17 x squared plus 6\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>17</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>6</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "2934e2a2-2637-44c9-8453-f6244769c06b", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"x squared minus 6\"><mrow>\n\t<msup>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t</msup>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>6</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "61b44804-0b3f-40d8-aa6d-9ccc5a990833", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"x squared plus 6\"><mrow>\n\t<msup>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t</msup>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>6</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. The given expression is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"9 x squared plus 6 minus 8 x squared\"><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. The terms <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"9 x squared\"><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"minus 8 x squared\"><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> are like terms. Combining these like terms yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x squared\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. It follows that the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 9 x squared plus 6 right parenthesis minus left parenthesis 8 x squared right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></math> is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x squared plus 6\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 9 x squared plus 6 right parenthesis plus left parenthesis 8 x squared right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></math>, not the given expression.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "8a43ff56-7c88-420c-8b4c-bc730b55e931", "correct_answer": ["D"]}